    "categories": [
      "emotion",
      "work",
      "sleep"
    ],
    "text": "It’s possible (although not very likely) to get pregnant soon after your period finishes if you ovulate early or have a short menstrual cycle. Having sex without penetration It’s also possible to get pregnant if you have sex without penetration (the penis entering your vagina). Pregnancy can happen if sperm comes into contact with your vagina if, for example: - you partner ejaculates very close to your vagina - your partner’s erect penis comes into contact with your vagina or vulva (genital area)",
    "score": 7
